    "createdAt": 1792949651803,
    "modifiedAt": 1792950696483,
    "collapsed": false,
    "note": "# key bindings\n\nCustomizable key bindings like neovim\n\nfew examples:\n\nin navigate mode:\n\n<leader>c - create a new cylinder with an arrow link to the selected node and goes into insert mode inside the new block\n\n<leader> ic - create a new cylinder without any arrow\n\n<leader>b - create a new block (rectangle) and goes into the block in insert mode.\n\n<leader>s - create a sub-block within the block\n\n<leader>ls - create a text area within the block separated by a line"
  },
